# Derived knowledge graph from `/graphify`. Rebuildable, sometimes megabytes.
graphify-out/

# Output of `/product-team-review`. The findings worth acting on become commits
# and issues; the run itself is a dated snapshot against one HEAD, and the
# rendered artifact already lives at claude.ai.
.product-team-review/

# Never a passphrase-encrypted backup. `dotfiles-secrets-export` refuses a
# destination inside a git work tree, and .gitleaks.toml has a rule for the age
# armour header — this is the third layer, for the copy that arrives by file
# manager or stray cp rather than by the export.
*.age

# Superpowers SDD scratch: ledger, briefs and review packages for a
# plan in flight. Rebuildable from git once the plan ships.
.superpowers/
